r: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 120; favorites: 6; remixes: 1.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, bento, charts, security, effect.\n## Overview\nOmnistack Animated Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nPlanetary Network Layer Stateful Architecture Distributed consensus mechanisms Real-time edge synchronization across nodes Immutable infrastructure telemetry Zero-latency deployment pipelines Automated global load balan…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Stateful Architecture; Dr. Elena Rostova; Marcus Vance; Sarah Lin; David Kim; Aurora Flux.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #1A5BFA, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #34D399, background #1A5BFA, surface #BFDBFE, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>OmniStack - Animated Opener</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#1a5bfa] font-sans text-white antialiased relative min-h-screen w-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden selection:bg-white/30 m-0 p-0\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n\n    <!-- Background Stripes & Animated Beams -->\n    <div id=\"bg-layer\" class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 flex w-full h-full overflow-hidden opacity-0\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #1a5bfa 0%, #1a5bfa 60%, #bfdbfe 100%);\">\n        <div class=\"w-full h-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto flex justify-between px-4 md:px-8\">\n            <div class=\"h-full border-r border-white/5 w-full relative hidden lg:block\">\n                <div class=\"v-beam absolute top-[-200px] right-[-1px] w-[1px] h-[200px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/60 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"h-full border-r border-white/5 w-full relative hidden md:block\">\n                <div class=\"v-beam absolute top-[-200px] right-[-1px] w-[1px] h-[200px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/60 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"h-full border-r border-white/5 w-full relative\">\n                <div class=\"v-beam absolute top-[-200px] right-[-1px] w-[1px] h-[200px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/60 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"h-full border-r border-white/5 w-full relative\">\n                <div class=\"v-beam absolute top-[-200px] right-[-1px] w-[1px] h-[200px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/60 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"h-full border-r border-white/5 w-full relative hidden md:block\">\n                <div class=\"v-beam absolute top-[-200px] right-[-1px] w-[1px] h-[200px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/60 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"h-full border-r border-white/5 w-full relative hidden lg:block\">\n                <div class=\"v-beam absolute top-[-200px] right-[-1px] w-[1px] h-[200px] bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-white/60 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Master Cinematic Canvas -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full h-screen flex items-center justify-center max-w-[1600px] mx-auto\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n\n        <!-- Sequence 1: The Blueprint (Typography) -->\n        <section id=\"seq-1\" class=\"absolute w-full flex flex-col items-center text-center z-20 px-8\" style=\"opacity: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"text-white/70 font-light tracking-tight text-xs md:text-sm uppercase mb-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:routing-3-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                Planetary Network Layer\n            </div>\n\n            <h1 class=\"font-extralight tracking-tighter leading-none text-white mb-10 text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-[7rem]\">\n                Stateful<br>Architecture\n            </h1>\n\n            <ul class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-4 md:gap-5 text-lg md:text-xl text-white/80 font-thin leading-tight w-full max-w-xl mx-auto text-left\">\n                <li class=\"list-item flex items-start gap-4 w-full\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/60 mt-[0.6em] flex-shrink-0 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4)]\"></span>\n                    <span>Distributed consensus mechanisms</span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"list-item flex items-start gap-4 w-full\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/60 mt-[0.6em] flex-shrink-0 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4)]\"></span>\n                    <span>Real-time edge synchronization across nodes</span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"list-item flex items-start gap-4 w-full\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/60 mt-[0.6em] flex-shrink-0 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4)]\"></span>\n                    <span>Immutable infrastructure telemetry</span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"list-item flex items-start gap-4 w-full\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/60 mt-[0.6em] flex-shrink-0 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4)]\"></span>\n                    <span>Zero-latency deployment pipelines</span>\n                </li>\n                <li class=\"list-item flex items-start gap-4 w-full\">\n                    <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/60 mt-[0.6em] flex-shrink-0 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4)]\"></span>\n                    <span>Automated global load balancing</span>\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Sequence 2: The Build (Node Grid Tunnel) -->\n        <section id=\"seq-2\" class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none z-30\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n\n            <!-- Node 1 -->\n            <div class=\"card-node absolute w-[260px] h-[180px] shadow-2xl\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.8) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 100%); padding: 1px; border-radius: 16px; opacity: 0;\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white w-full h-full rounded-[15px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between text-[#1a5bfa]\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-tight\">Dr. Elena Rostova</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-[#1a5bfa]/70 mt-1\">Quantum Edge Compute</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-light bg-[#1a5bfa]/5 w-fit px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md tracking-tight\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-500 text-sm\"></iconify-icon> Active • 4ms\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5\">\n                            <p class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#1a5bfa]/80 tracking-tight\">Cluster 01, Core</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-xl opacity-40\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Node 2 -->\n            <div class=\"card-node absolute w-[260px] h-[180px] shadow-2xl\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%); padding: 1px; border-radius: 16px; opacity: 0;\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl w-full h-full rounded-[15px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between text-white\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-tight\">Marcus Vance</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-thin text-white/70 mt-1\">Packet Routing</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-light bg-white/10 w-fit px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md tracking-tight\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon> Active • 9ms\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5\">\n                            <p class=\"text-xs font-thin text-white/80 tracking-tight\">Cluster 02, Edge</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:routing-2-linear\" class=\"text-xl opacity-50\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Node 3 -->\n            <div class=\"card-node absolute w-[260px] h-[180px] shadow-2xl\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.8) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 100%); padding: 1px; border-radius: 16px; opacity: 0;\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white w-full h-full rounded-[15px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between text-[#1a5bfa]\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-tight\">Sarah Lin</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-[#1a5bfa]/70 mt-1\">Ephemeral State</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-light bg-[#1a5bfa]/5 w-fit px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md tracking-tight\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-500 text-sm\"></iconify-icon> Synced • 3.4TB/s\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5\">\n                            <p class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#1a5bfa]/80 tracking-tight\">Cluster 03, Sync</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:database-linear\" class=\"text-xl opacity-40\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Node 4 -->\n            <div class=\"card-node absolute w-[260px] h-[180px] shadow-2xl\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%); padding: 1px; border-radius: 16px; opacity: 0;\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl w-full h-full rounded-[15px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between text-white\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-tight\">David Kim</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-thin text-white/70 mt-1\">Threat Mitigation</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-light bg-white/10 w-fit px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md tracking-tight\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon> Secure • 22k/min\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5\">\n                            <p class=\"text-xs font-thin text-white/80 tracking-tight\">Cluster 04, Shield</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-warning-linear\" class=\"text-xl opacity-50\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Node 5 -->\n            <div class=\"card-node absolute w-[260px] h-[180px] shadow-2xl\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.8) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 100%); padding: 1px; border-radius: 16px; opacity: 0;\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white w-full h-full rounded-[15px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between text-[#1a5bfa]\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-tight\">Aurora Flux</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-extralight text-[#1a5bfa]/70 mt-1\">Ingress Mesh</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-light bg-[#1a5bfa]/5 w-fit px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md tracking-tight\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-500 text-sm\"></iconify-icon> Active • 60k Conns\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5\">\n                            <p class=\"text-xs font-light text-[#1a5bfa]/80 tracking-tight\">Cluster 05, Entry</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:monitor-smartphone-linear\" class=\"text-xl opacity-40\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Node 6 -->\n            <div class=\"card-node absolute w-[260px] h-[180px] shadow-2xl\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 100%); padding: 1px; border-radius: 16px; opacity: 0;\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl w-full h-full rounded-[15px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between text-white\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xs font-light tracking-tight\">Silas Cole</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs font-thin text-white/70 mt-1\">Network Topology</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-light bg-white/10 w-fit px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md tracking-tight\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-emerald-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon> Active • < 1 Hop\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\">\n                        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-0.5\">\n                            <p class=\"text-xs font-thin text-white/80 tracking-tight\">Cluster 06, Route</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:globus-linear\" class=\"text-xl opacity-50\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Sequence 3: Resolve (Final Logo Lockup) -->\n        <section id=\"seq-3\" class=\"absolute flex flex-col items-center justify-center z-40\" style=\"opacity: 0;\">\n            <div class=\"w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)]\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" class=\"text-3xl text-white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <h2 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extralight tracking-tight text-white mb-2\">System Active</h2>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-thin text-white/60 tracking-tight uppercase\">\n                <span>OmniStack Layer</span>\n                <span class=\"w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(52,211,153,0.8)]\"></span>\n                <span>0ms Latency</span>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            // Check for reduced motion preference\n            const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia(\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\").matches;\n\n            // Continual background beams loop (simplified for pure CSS fallback initially, hijacked by GSAP below)\n            const beams = document.querySelectorAll('.v-beam');\n            if (!prefersReducedMotion && beams.length > 0) {\n                gsap.fromTo(beams,\n                    { y: -200 },\n                    {\n                        y: window.innerHeight + 400,\n                        duration: 2.5,\n                        ease: \"linear\",\n                        repeat: -1,\n                        stagger: { each: 0.6, from: \"random\" }\n                    }\n                );\n            }\n\n            if (prefersReducedMotion) {\n                // Static resolve state for reduced motion\n                gsap.set(\"#bg-layer\", { opacity: 1 });\n                gsap.set(\"#seq-3\", { opacity: 1 });\n                return;\n            }\n\n            // Master Cinematic Timeline\n            const tl = gsap.timeline();\n\n            // Init States\n            gsap.set(\"#seq-1\", { scale: 1.5, filter: \"blur(20px)\", opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set(\".list-item\", { x: -40, opacity: 0, filter: \"blur(5px)\" });\n\n            // Randomly scatter nodes in 3D Z-space off-screen towards camera\n            gsap.utils.toArray('.card-node').forEach((card, i) => {\n                const spreadX = (i % 2 === 0 ? -1 : 1) * (150 + Math.random() * 100);\n                const spreadY = -150 + (i * 60);\n                gsap.set(card, {\n                    z: 2000, // Starts behind camera\n                    x: spreadX,\n                    y: spreadY,\n                    rotationX: 15,\n                    rotationY: spreadX > 0 ? -15 : 15,\n                    opacity: 0\n                });\n            });\n\n            gsap.set(\"#seq-3\", { scale: 0.8, filter: \"blur(30px)\", opacity: 0 });\n\n            // ---------------------------------------------------------\n            // Sequence 1: Intro Build (0s - 4.5s)\n            // ---------------------------------------------------------\n            tl.to(\"#bg-layer\", { opacity: 1, duration: 1, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, 0)\n              .to(\"#seq-1\", {\n                  duration: 2.5,\n                  scale: 1,\n                  filter: \"blur(0px)\",\n                  opacity: 1,\n                  ease: \"expo.out\"\n              }, 0.2)\n              .to(\".list-item\", {\n                  duration: 1.2,\n                  x: 0,\n                  opacity: 1,\n                  filter: \"blur(0px)\",\n                  stagger: 0.1,\n                  ease: \"power3.out\"\n              }, 1.2)\n\n              // Transition out Seq 1\n              .to(\"#seq-1\", {\n                  duration: 1.5,\n                  scale: 0.5,\n                  z: -1000,\n                  opacity: 0,\n                  filter: \"blur(15px)\",\n                  ease: \"power4.in\"\n              }, 4.5);\n\n            // ---------------------------------------------------------\n            // Sequence 2: The Node Tunnel (5.5s - 9.0s)\n            // ---------------------------------------------------------\n            tl.to(\".card-node\", {\n                duration: 2.5,\n                z: (i) => -600 + (i * 120), // Lock into depth grid\n                x: (i) => (i % 2 === 0 ? -180 : 180) + (i % 3 * 20),\n                y: (i) => -180 + (i * 70),\n                rotationX: 5,\n                rotationY: (i) => i % 2 === 0 ? -5 : 5,\n                opacity: 1,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                ease: \"expo.out\"\n            }, 5.2)\n\n            // Hold and float slightly\n            .to(\".card-node\", {\n                y: \"+=15\",\n                duration: 2,\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: 1,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n            }, \"-=1.5\")\n\n            // Aggressive transition out: Cards fly past camera\n            .to(\".card-node\", {\n                duration: 1.2,\n                z: 1500,\n                opacity: 0,\n                stagger: 0.05,\n                ease: \"power4.in\"\n            }, 8.5);\n\n            // ---------------------------------------------------------\n            // Sequence 3: Resolve (9.5s -> Hold)\n            // ---------------------------------------------------------\n            tl.to(\"#seq-3\", {\n                duration: 3,\n                scale: 1,\n                opacity: 1,\n                filter: \"blur(0px)\",\n                ease: \"expo.out\"\n            }, 9.2)\n\n            // Subtle continual float on resolve\n            .to(\"#seq-3\", {\n                y: -10,\n                duration: 3,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1\n            }, 10.0);\n\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "omnistack-animated-opener.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/omnistack-animated-opener.jpg", "source_name": "omnistack-animated-opener-DESIGN.md", "views": 349, "forks": 11, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:33:29.064757+00:00"}